# Credentials: only deliberately named templates may be tracked.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/config.env*
!**/.env.example
!**/config.example.env
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# Runtime conversation, tasks, models and recordings.
**/server/data/
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.db
**/*.wav
**/*.aiff
**/*.pcm
**/*.log
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]

# SDKs, local device state and generated builds.
**/build*/
**/managed_components/
**/sdkconfig
**/sdkconfig.old
**/.codex-runs/
**/.mosaico-state/
**/.tools/
**/artifacts/
**/assets/generated/
.DS_Store
